        <description>The main issue occurs when running to_process.run_sync() in subprocesses, where a TypeError: 'NoneType' object cannot be interpreted as an integer happens. This is likely related to the handling of process initialization where a value expected to be an integer is None.</description>
        <contract>
            Fix the TypeError in to_process.run_sync() where a None value is being interpreted as an integer. Specifically, ensure that when initializing worker processes, all values that are expected to be integers (like process IDs or file descriptors) are properly validated and handled when they are None.
